WEBVTT

00:00:01.319 --> 00:00:09.920
Good afternoon, everyone. Today we’ll talk
about udder inflammation — mastitis —
and our experience with such cases.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:15.839
Over the past week,
we received a new product
from the company Eshel.

00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:24.320
We received it and started using it.
We tried it on several cows —
and we are already seeing results.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:30.000
The results are truly impressive.
Here is the product.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.360
The reading is 35.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:42.920
The dosage is 35 ml
twice a day.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.920
Now let’s take a look:
cow No. 8912.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:54.960
The numbers speak for themselves.
In the barn, the data tell the story.
Here is the onset of mastitis — a sharp drop.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:05.559
On Thursday or Friday, we received
this product and started
using Garliboost.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:12.680
And look:
today the daily milk yield
is already 8 liters.

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:20.079
Here is her chart:
the red line is mastitis,
the blue line is milk.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:26.320
Milk yield has started rising again.
Now let’s look
at another cow.

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:29.320
Here you can see her readings.

00:01:30.159 --> 00:01:36.079
After a sharp drop,
we started giving Garliboost —
and the readings quickly improved.

00:01:36.079 --> 00:01:42.000
And what is especially important —
the cow keeps her appetite
and continues going to the feed trough.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.119
She eats, does not spend all her time
lying on the bedding, and behaves
as usual.

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:54.479
There are photos
that speak for themselves:
even during mastitis, you can see…

00:01:54.479 --> 00:01:59.240
…how the cow’s condition
is recovering,
while her appetite remains intact.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:03.680
So, friends,
I recommend that you…

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:11.840
…especially during such a difficult time,
consider this product
and use it.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.368
Have a great day, everyone!
